The model files distributed with this repository as GitHub Release assets
(embeddinggemma-300m_seq64_q8.tflite, embeddinggemma-300m_seq256_q8.tflite) are Model Derivatives
of google/embeddinggemma-300m. They were modified by converting the original checkpoint with
litert-torch 0.9.4 (fixed input lengths of 64 and 256 tokens, dynamic_int8 quantization).
No weights were retrained or fine-tuned.

